# SonicForge — Environment Variables

> Copy this file to `.env` in the repo root and fill in values.
> Never commit a real `.env` file — it is in .gitignore.

---

## Backend (apps/api/.env)

```env
# ── Application ──────────────────────────────────────────────
APP_ENV=development                    # development | production
APP_HOST=0.0.0.0
APP_PORT=8000
LOG_LEVEL=info                         # debug | info | warning | error

# ── Storage ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Root directory where all SonicForge projects are stored.
# Defaults to ~/sonicforge-projects if not set.
PROJECTS_ROOT=                         # e.g. C:\Users\you\sonicforge-projects

# Directory where downloaded AI model weights are cached.
# Defaults to ~/.sonicforge/models if not set.
MODELS_CACHE_DIR=                      # e.g. C:\Users\you\.sonicforge\models

# ── Database ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SQLite database file path (relative to PROJECTS_ROOT or absolute)
DATABASE_URL=sqlite+aiosqlite:///./sonicforge.db

# ── Redis / Celery ───────────────────────────────────────────
REDIS_URL=redis://localhost:6379/0
CELERY_BROKER_URL=redis://localhost:6379/0
CELERY_RESULT_BACKEND=redis://localhost:6379/1

# ── AI Providers (all optional) ──────────────────────────────
# Hugging Face API key — only needed if using HF Serverless Inference API
# Get one free at https://huggingface.co/settings/tokens
HUGGINGFACE_API_KEY=

# ── CORS ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Frontend origin (Vite dev server)
CORS_ORIGINS=http://localhost:5173
```

---

## Frontend (apps/web/.env)

```env
# Backend API base URL
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8000

# App name shown in the UI
VITE_APP_NAME=SonicForge
```

---

## Notes

- `HUGGINGFACE_API_KEY` is **never** required for local model inference.
- Setting it unlocks the HF Serverless Inference API as an optional faster backend.
- All keys are stored backend-side only — the frontend never sees them.
